WEBVTT

00:20:59.803 --> 00:21:02.143
perhaps where they lost
everything, as I did,

00:21:02.167 --> 00:21:04.014
and started out all over again:

00:21:04.038 --> 00:21:07.971
some of these things
will seem very familiar.

00:21:09.106 --> 00:21:12.512
There is recovery.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.882
There is redemption.

00:21:17.709 --> 00:21:20.495
And there is resurrection.

00:21:21.555 --> 00:21:23.761
There are resurrection themes

00:21:23.785 --> 00:21:26.534
in every society
that has ever been studied,

00:21:26.558 --> 00:21:29.533
and it is because
not just only do we fantasize

00:21:29.557 --> 00:21:32.428
about the possibility
of resurrection and recovery,